<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Chopin returns for his adult preventive visit eight weeks after completing tuberculosis treatment. He has had no cough, fever, night sweats, or weight loss since, and he has gained another 1.2 kg. He teaches his full schedule of about fifteen students a week and is preparing a small recital. He has a glass of wine with dinner a few times a week and has never smoked. His mood is good. He completed the health risk assessment before the visit. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Visit</td><td>Adult preventive visit, age 28</td></tr><tr><td>Active conditions</td><td>Pulmonary tuberculosis, treatment completed; malnutrition resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>None since tuberculosis treatment ended</td></tr><tr><td>Functional status</td><td>Independent; teaching full time</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>Health risk assessment. Completed by the patient before the visit and reviewed during the visit. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Domain</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Self-rated health</td><td>Good, much better than in the spring</td></tr><tr><td>Psychosocial</td><td>Supported by friends from home and by his students; he told his students about the illness and none left</td></tr><tr><td>Behavioral</td><td>A glass of wine with dinner a few times a week (AUDIT-C 2); no tobacco or other drugs</td></tr><tr><td>Nutrition</td><td>Three meals and two snacks a day; no supplement drinks since August</td></tr><tr><td>Physical activity</td><td>Walks about 30 minutes most days</td></tr><tr><td>Activities of daily living</td><td>Independent in all</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About seven hours a night; no night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No firearms; smoke detector working; wears a seat belt</td></tr><tr><td>Hearing and vision</td><td>No concerns</td></tr><tr><td>Sexual health</td><td>Discussed privately; no concerns</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

